<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>MITH WAR MECHA // ARCHIVE</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #0d0f12;
      --card-bg: #15191e;
      --accent-color: #00e5ff;
      --accent-warn: #ffaa00;
      --text-main: #e0e6ed;
      --text-dim: #7e8c9a;
      --border-color: #263238;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background-image: 
        linear-gradient(rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 30px 30px;
    }

    header {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .system-status {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: var(--accent-color);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-color);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-color);
      padding-left: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .mech-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .mech-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .mech-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--accent-color);
    }

    .mech-thumb {
      width: 100%;
      height: 200px;
      background-color: #080a0c;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .mech-info {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .mech-id {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--accent-warn);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .mech-name {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0.25rem 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .mech-desc {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="system-status">SYS.VER // ONLINE ARCHIVE</div>
    <h1>Mith War Mecha</h1>
    <p class="tagline">WORLD DESIGN &amp; MECHA ARCHIVES</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="section-title">Unit Specifications // 機体一覧</div>

    <div class="mech-grid">
      <!-- カード例 1 -->
      <div class="mech-card">
        <div class="mech-thumb">[ 機体画像プレビュー ]</div>
        <div class="mech-info">
          <div class="mech-id">UNIT // 01</div>
          <h2 class="mech-name">SAMPLE MECHA</h2>
          <p class="mech-desc">機体の概要やコンセプト設定がここに入ります。後からテキストと画像を自由に差し替え可能です。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; MITH WAR MECHA PROJECT. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
